  "full_text": "Yeah, I said I didn't like the nigger music. Today it seems like they don't play any white rock and roll. Kind of sucks. I like blues. Blues are cool. Rap is, you know, it's okay, I guess, but I really want, you know, like, is there any good rock you could do? Like, Red Fang is good. Red Fang is good. I'm just a little bit, it's depressing, you know? Maybe the gold mines have been exhausted, you know? I guess that happens. Something like that. Is that true? I don't know. I don't really know. I like Cuban music. Rhythms, I guess. Not really. Maybe if they sang English words. One time there was... You know, I really don't... I really don't like Mexican music. But one time they sang in English and it was tolerable. I like La Bamba. Parabola, parabola, La Bamba. That's a good song. It's pretty funny. It's an excellent song. I'm not the captain. I'm just... Pibeseth shall fall by the sword, and these cities shall go into captivity. The Tepanides also that day shall be darkened. When I shall break there the yokes of Egypt, and the pomp of their strength shall cease in her. And for her a cloud shall cover her, as her daughter shall go into captivity. This I execute judgment. I didn't know that I am the Lord.",
